        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D Snake game. While preserving the classic gameplay, we've not only introduced a groundbreaking arcade mode but also added three distinct modes for each variant: Normal, Physical, and Funny. Within these three modes, we've further revolutionized the experience by incorporating three additional gameplay options: Solo, AI, and vs AI. We have also designed nine gorgeous maps, which, when combined, will present players with hundreds of distinct challenges. More maps will be available in future updates. We've also created nine adorable snakes and nine mouthwatering foods. Completing all challenges in a level unlocks one snake and one food. The game's UI animations are nothing short of breathtaking, with every frame radiating elegance, accompanied by thrilling music and lifelike sound effects, all of which never fail to leave players feeling utterly refreshed and delighted. The most incredible feature of this game is the Snake AI. We have utilized cutting edge technology to train an extraordinary Snake neural network model, and pioneered a way to enable players to compete directly with the Snake AI. This is a truly unprecedented feat.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D Snake game. While preserving the classic gameplay, we've not only introduced a groundbreaking arcade mode but also added three distinct modes for each variant: Normal, Physical, and Funny. Within these three modes, we've further revolutionized the experience by incorporating three additional gameplay options: Solo, AI, and vs AI. We have also designed nine gorgeous maps, which, when combined, will present players with hundreds of distinct challenges. More maps will be available in future updates. We've also created nine adorable snakes and nine mouthwatering foods. Completing all challenges in a level unlocks one snake and one food. The game's UI animations are nothing short of breathtaking, with every frame radiating elegance, accompanied by thrilling music and lifelike sound effects, all of which never fail to leave players feeling utterly refreshed and delighted. The most incredible feature of this game is the Snake AI. We have utilized cutting edge technology to train an extraordinary Snake neural network model, and pioneered a way to enable players to compete directly with the Snake AI. This is a truly unprecedented feat.</p>",
        "short_description": "The classic game Snake, once a global sensation, has now been reimagined with groundbreaking innovations and revolutionary AI that boasts extraordinary performance!",
        "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean",
